abstract: >-
  Typed, deterministic control-plane primitives for graph-native agent harnesses, including
  immutable graph definitions, hash-chained execution events, replayable state reduction,
  deterministic scheduling, versioned rewriting, and graph-authorized completion.
keywords:
  - "agent harness"
  - "control plane"
  - "graph engineering"
  - "deterministic orchestration"
  - "agent evaluation"
